Have you ever heard of the Hawaii chair? It's a gyrating desk chair which came on the market in 2007 and promised to give your abs a workout while you sat at your desk. It feels great on my abs. I can really feel this working. Hawaii chair while answering phones, using the computer, balancing books, or filing paperwork. It turned out, though, that office workers didn't want to hula at their desks, and the chair was a flop.
你听说过夏威夷椅吗？这是一款在2007年上市的旋转办公椅，号称能让你在坐在办公桌前的时候锻炼腹肌。我的腹肌感觉很好。我真的能感觉到它在起作用。在接听电话、使用电脑、对账或整理文件时使用夏威夷椅。然而事实证明，办公室职员并不想在办公桌前扭呼啦圈，这款椅子以失败告终。

